msgstr "संख्यात्मक"

msgid ""
"If selected, users can enter multiple values in the form of 1+2+3 (for "
"OR) or 1,2,3 (for AND)."
msgstr ""
"यदि चयन गरियो भने, "
"प्रयोगकर्ताहरूले 1+2+3 (OR का "
