"If unchecked, all warnings about the Webform Clientside Validation "
"will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"यदि चयन नगरिएको भए, Webform Clientside "
"Validation सम्बन्धी सबै "
"चेतावनीहरू असक्षम "
"गरिनेछन्।"

msgid "Show remove element button"
msgstr ""
"हटाउने (remove) बटन "
"देखाउनुहोस्"

